ent-WH40KMurderMysteryKnife = murderer knife
    .desc = One clean hit is enough.

ent-WH40KMurderMysterySheriffRevolver = sheriff revolver
    .desc = Three rounds and one shot at justice.

ent-WH40KMurderMysterySheriffPinpointer = sheriff revolver pinpointer
    .desc = A handheld tracker handed to every participant of a Murder Mystery round. Locks onto the sheriff revolver only while it lies unattended on the ground - if it is in someone's hands the device falls silent to protect the sheriff's identity.

ent-WH40KMurderMysteryClue = evidence note
    .desc = A damning scrap of evidence. Collect enough of these and the sheriff's revolver will be yours.
